    <item>
      <title>【建站日志】如何让自己的博客被搜索引擎收录</title>
      <link>https://www.steamedfish.top/post/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Nov 2025 23:51:15 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://www.steamedfish.top/post/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Bing Webmasster Tools是必应的网站管理员工具，可以添加个人网站并带进行一些网站操作。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;打开&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.bing.com/webmasters&#34;&gt;Bing Webmasster Tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;点击&amp;quot;开始&amp;quot;或右上角&amp;quot;登录&amp;quot;以登录到官网。可以选择三种登录账号：Google、Microsoft、Facebook。这里我用 Microsoft 账号登录。






    


       
    



&lt;div class=&#34;post-img-view&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a
    data-fancybox=&#34;post-post/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide.md&#34;
    href=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/1.png&#34;
    data-caption=&#34;&#34;
    data-barba-prevent=&#34;all&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;img
      src=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/1.png&#34;
      srcset=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/1.png 2x&#34;
      alt=&#34;&#34;
      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto;&#34;
    /&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
    
  
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;初次登录会提示你添加网站，有两种添加方式：从 GSC 导入、手动添加。如果您的网站被 谷歌GSC 收录，可以用 GSC 直接导入。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这里我选择手动添加，输入自己的域名，点击添加（在笔者查阅资料时，有人说这里可能会出现网络问题，可以多试几次，不过我并没有遇到此类问题，或许是因为当时开启了科学上网工具）






    


       
    



&lt;div class=&#34;post-img-view&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a
    data-fancybox=&#34;post-post/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide.md&#34;
    href=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/2.png&#34;
    data-caption=&#34;&#34;
    data-barba-prevent=&#34;all&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;img
      src=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/2.png&#34;
      srcset=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/2.png 2x&#34;
      alt=&#34;&#34;
      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto;&#34;
    /&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
    
  
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;现在需要你验证网站的所有权，即验证这个网站是属于你的。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这里我选择第一种方式，使用XML文件验证






    


       
    



&lt;div class=&#34;post-img-view&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a
    data-fancybox=&#34;post-post/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide.md&#34;
    href=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/3.png&#34;
    data-caption=&#34;&#34;
    data-barba-prevent=&#34;all&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;img
      src=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/3.png&#34;
      srcset=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/3.png 2x&#34;
      alt=&#34;&#34;
      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto;&#34;
    /&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
    
  
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;下载XML文件，放在网站静态资源目录下：&lt;code&gt;/static/BingSiteAuth.xml&lt;/code&gt;，重新生成网站并推送到远程仓库中，可以检查远程仓库根目录中是否有&lt;code&gt;BingSiteAuth.xml&lt;/code&gt;






    


       
    



&lt;div class=&#34;post-img-view&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a
    data-fancybox=&#34;post-post/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide.md&#34;
    href=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/4.png&#34;
    data-caption=&#34;&#34;
    data-barba-prevent=&#34;all&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;img
      src=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/4.png&#34;
      srcset=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/4.png 2x&#34;
      alt=&#34;&#34;
      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto;&#34;
    /&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
    
  
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;点击验证，添加成功






    


       
    



&lt;div class=&#34;post-img-view&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a
    data-fancybox=&#34;post-post/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide.md&#34;
    href=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/5.png&#34;
    data-caption=&#34;&#34;
    data-barba-prevent=&#34;all&#34;
  &gt;
    &lt;img
      src=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/5.png&#34;
      srcset=&#34;https://www.steamedfish.top/images/hugo-log/hugo-blog-search-engine-indexing-guide/5.png 2x&#34;
      alt=&#34;&#34;
      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto;&#34;
    /&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
    
  
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</description>
